<ContentCard class="content-card oral-history-update">
  <p class="eyebrow">Collection Update</p>

  <h2>More Oral Histories Are on the Way</h2>

  <p>
    Additional oral-history interviews are currently being prepared for
    online access. This work includes returning to the original source media,
    creating new preservation masters, producing web-accessible video files,
    and preparing transcripts and supporting archival metadata.
  </p>

  <p class="publication-meta">
    Please come back often as updates are ongoing
  </p>

  <p>
    Thank you for your patience as we work to preserve these recordings
    and make them accessible for future generations.
  </p>
</ContentCard>

